# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The re-publish clears the debt without waiting
# for acknowledgements or lease expiry.
MODULE: RetrySucceedsEarly
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the re-publish reports success before the captured silos are covered
PERTURBS: RetrySucceeds
BOUNDS: MaxFailures = 1

--- FIND
    /\ wstate = "retrying" /\ alive[wsilo]
    /\ \A t \in Silos : pend[t] \in {"no", "lapsed"}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the wait is skipped.
    /\ wstate = "retrying" /\ alive[wsilo]
    /\ TRUE
--- END
